
// Azure Cloud Security Lab
// Module 1: KQL fundamentals
// Purpose: Practise querying sample data in Azure Data Explorer.

// Query 1: Display 10 sample records.
StormEvents
| take 10

// Query 2: Count all records.
StormEvents
| count

// Query 3: Select useful fields.
StormEvents
| project StartTime, State, EventType
| take 10

// Query 4: Filter for tornado events.
StormEvents
| where EventType == "Tornado"
| project StartTime, State, EventType
| take 10
